OL,3,GNEWSAPlea over 999 demand ahead of
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to only call 999
OL,7,Ffor serious or life-threatening
OL,8,Fincidents as emergency services prepare
OL,9,Ffor a busy spell around Thursday's
OL,10,FBonfire Night.
OL,12,FSouth Western Ambulance Service
OL,13,F(SWASFT) said it responded to more than
OL,14,F7,000 incidents over the Halloween
OL,15,Fweekend, which was 10% higher than
OL,16,Fexpected.
OL,18,FThe service said it had a mix of calls
OL,19,Frelating to seasonal illnesses, colder
OL,20,Fweather and ongoing delays in
OL,21,Ftransferring patients from ambulances
OL,22,Finto hospital care.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
