OL,3,GNEWSAPlea over 999 demand ahead of
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FWayne Darch, director of operations at
OL,7,FSWASFT said: "It is vital that
OL,8,Femergency ambulance resources are
OL,9,Fprioritised for patients whose lives
OL,10,Fmay be at risk."
